Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:the process begins by receiving the invoice -> i2:it is sorted per client -> i3:it is then sorted per vendor -> i4:attach the invoice entry form to the invoice -> i5:the required information is entered onto the form -> i6:the completeness of the invoice is checked -> i8:If it is complete, the information for the SLA is entered. -> i9:The date for completion is also entered -> i10:the priority is checked -> i11:If the priority is high -> i12:a red stamp is placed on the entry invoice -> i14:The invoice compliance is then checked -> i16:If it is not complete, the check continues. -> i14:The invoice compliance is then checked
- [N2] Omitted trace (input 5): i1:the process begins by receiving the invoice -> i2:it is sorted per client -> i3:it is then sorted per vendor -> i4:attach the invoice entry form to the invoice -> i5:the required information is entered onto the form -> i6:the completeness of the invoice is checked -> i8:If it is complete, the information for the SLA is entered. -> i9:The date for completion is also entered -> i10:the priority is checked -> i13:If it is low, the process continues. -> i14:The invoice compliance is then checked -> i16:If it is not complete, the check continues. -> i14:The invoice compliance is then checked